   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 3849,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/birth/races/yeek.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "They possess the #GOLD#Dominant Will#WHITE# talent which allows them to temporarily subvert the mind of a lesser creature. When the effect ends, the creature dies.",
   "target": "他们天生掌握 #GOLD# 主导思维#WHITE#，使他们能在短时间内控制一个较弱生物的思维。当效果结束时，被控制目标死亡。",
